      "args": {
        "case_id": "model-hoist",
        "text": "Prompt caching depends on an identical leading token sequence.\n\nThe SDK checks the longest matching request prefix and recomputes its suffix. Measure hits using `cache_read_input_tokens`. Therefore put stable system text before the volatile user turn."
